### UStudent API - Drop Course Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

### Student 1 Drops CS101
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/drop?studentId=1

### Student 1 Drops MATH101
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/3/drop?studentId=1

### Student 1 Drops CS201
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/drop?studentId=1

### Student 2 Drops CS101
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/drop?studentId=2

### Test Dropping Non-Enrolled Course (should fail)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/2/drop?studentId=1

### Test Invalid Student ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/1/drop?studentId=999

### Test Invalid Course ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/courses/999/drop?studentId=1